<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Find contact details for services - GOV.UK</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #0b0c0c;
  }
  .top-bar {
    background-color: #1d70b8;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 15px 30px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .top-bar .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .top-bar .logo .crown {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .top-bar .right-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .top-bar .divider {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    height: 20px;
  }
  .breadcrumb {
    padding: 15px 30px 0 30px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: #0b0c0c;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .content-wrap {
    padding: 20px 30px 40px 30px;
    max-width: 1000px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 20px 0 30px 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .service-list {
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .service-item {
    border-top: 1px solid #b1b4b6;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }
  .service-item a.title {
    color: #1d70b8;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 19px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .service-item p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .more-topics {
    padding: 15px 0;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .more-topics a {
    color: #1d70b8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .more-topics .triangle {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }
  .bottom-line {
    border-top: 1px solid #b1b4b6;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .info-block {
    max-width: 620px;
    padding-top: 25px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .info-block p {
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
  }
  .info-block a {
    color: #1d70b8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .blue-strip {
    height: 8px;
    background-color: #1d70b8;
  }
  .footer {
    background-color: #f3f2f1;
    padding: 40px 30px 60px 30px;
  }
  .footer .crown-icon {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .footer-columns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 60px;
  }
  .footer-columns .col {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .footer h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .footer .divider-line {
    border-top: 1px solid #b1b4b6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .footer-links-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .footer-links-group .sub-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 15px;
  }
  .footer-links-group .sub-col a,
  .footer .col > a {
    color: #0b0c0c;
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .services-info-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 15px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-bar">
    <div class="logo"><span class="crown">&#9962;</span>GOV&#8226;UK</div>
    <div class="right-links">
      <span>&#8964; Menu</span>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <span>&#128269;</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="#">Home</a>
  </div>

  <div class="content-wrap">
    <h1>Find contact details<br>for services</h1>

    <div class="service-list">
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">Universal Credit</a>
        <p>Contact the Universal Credit team to get help with applying for Universal Credit or managing your claim.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">Driving licences and car tax</a>
        <p>Contact DVLA for questions about driving, vehicle tax and registrations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">HM Revenue and Customs (HMRC)</a>
        <p>Contact HMRC for questions about tax, including self assessment and PAYE.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">Passport advice and complaints</a>
        <p>Get help with your passport application and renewals if you're a British Citizen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">Student Finance England</a>
        <p>Get help with student loan applications and grants.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">Jobcentre Plus</a>
        <p>Get advice on benefits such as Jobseeker's Allowance (JSA).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-item">
        <a class="title" href="#">UK Visas and Immigration</a>
        <p>Contact UK Visas and Immigration about your application.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="more-topics">
        <span class="triangle">&#9658;</span><a href="#">More topics</a>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-line"></div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <p>Use the <a href="#">GOV.UK contact form</a> to send your questions or comments about the website.</p>
        <p>Check the <a href="#">GOV.UK help pages</a> to find out about the use of cookies, accessibility of the site, the privacy policy and terms and conditions of use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="blue-strip"></div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="crown-icon">&#9962;</div>
    <div class="footer-columns">
      <div class="col">
        <h2>Services and information</h2>
        <div class="divider-line"></div>
        <div class="footer-links-group">
          <div class="sub-col">
            <a href="#">Benefits</a>
            <a href="#">Births, death, marriages and care</a>
            <a href="#">Business and self-employed</a>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-col">
            <a href="#">Education and learning</a>
            <a href="#">Employing people</a>
            <a href="#">Environment and countryside</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h2>Government activity</h2>
        <div class="divider-line"></div>
        <div class="services-info-col">
          <a href="#">Departments</a>
          <a href="#">News</a>
          <a href="#">Guidance and regulation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
